                                        "entry_id": "1cfa713c-1787-360b-99ce-f32a03b84c6f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a nomadic people from the Sinai near the Roman province of Arabia in the early centuries CE, who were specifically distinct from Arabs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
